1.	Input 1: Room capacity – set capacity and monitor via student checking in, checking out
2.	Process: 
-	Add student to room capacity count, if checking in
-	Remove student from room capacity count, if checking out
-	Compare to room capacity
3.	Output: 
-	Show current room capacity
-	Display alert if room full
4.	Input 2: Projector status
5.	Process: 
-	Display projector status
-	Check if projector on or off
6.	Output: 
-	If projector is turned on, turn it off
-	If projector is turned off, turn it on
7.	Input 3: Temperature - set parameters, (Temperature must be between 16 and 28 C only)
8.	Process: 
-	Read room temperature
9.	Output:
-	Display alert if temperature >28C
-	Display alert if temperature <16C
10.	Process: Collate data
11.	Output: Generate report show room status
